    },
    {
      "name": "Comida",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "toy-food",
      "description": "Physical fruit: drag to the mouth or activate to feed. Only this control is unavailable while its fruit is being eaten.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-toy-food\" aria-label=\"Dar comida\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"68\" rx=\"27\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#63419b15\"/>\n<path d=\"M40 22C12 7 8 36 20 56c7 12 14 7 20 7s13 5 20-7C72 36 68 7 40 22Z\" fill=\"#F07D91\" stroke=\"#BC5676\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"m40 24 2-14\" stroke=\"#76513F\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M42 15c0-12 16-12 18-8-4 9-10 10-18 8Z\" fill=\"#69AF87\"/>\n<path d=\"M23 30c-3 4-3 8-2 12\" stroke=\"#FFE0E6\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</svg><span>Comida</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-toy-food{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;border:0;padding:0;width:86px;color:var(--ink,#493366);background:transparent;font:700 13px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}.ds-toy-food svg{width:80px;height:80px;pointer-events:none}.ds-toy-food:active{cursor:grabbing}.ds-toy-food:hover:not(:disabled) svg{filter:brightness(1.04)}.ds-toy-food:disabled{cursor:default}.ds-toy-food[data-away=\"true\"] svg{opacity:0}.ds-toy-food:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pelota",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "toy-ball",
      "description": "Physical ball: drag or activate to launch; the character chases and nudges it. While active, this same control reads Guardar, has aria-label=\"Guardar la pelota\" and aria-pressed=\"true\". Tap or keyboard activation stores it, as does dragging the live ball back home. Storage ends chase/play, returns the character toward center and preserves food. The stored control reads Pelota, has aria-label=\"Lanzar la pelota\" and aria-pressed=\"false\".",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-toy-ball\" aria-label=\"Lanzar la pelota\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"68\" rx=\"27\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#63419b15\"/>\n<circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"36\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#7CC8A9\" stroke=\"#376D5C\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"36\" r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#376D5C\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"m40 8 0 15m-24 27 13-7m35 7-13-7\" stroke=\"#376D5C\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M23 23c3-4 6-6 11-7\" stroke=\"#C9F0DF\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</svg><span>Pelota</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-toy-ball{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;border:0;padding:0;width:86px;color:var(--ink,#493366);background:transparent;font:700 13px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}.ds-toy-ball svg{width:80px;height:80px;pointer-events:none}.ds-toy-ball:active{cursor:grabbing}.ds-toy-ball:hover:not(:disabled) svg{filter:brightness(1.04)}.ds-toy-ball:disabled{cursor:default}.ds-toy-ball[data-away=\"true\"] svg{opacity:.2}.ds-toy-ball:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
