      "description": "Cream circular pause/resume control; stops simulation, cancels dragging and stops audio.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pause\" aria-label=\"Pausar\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5v14M16 5v14\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-pause{background:var(--cream,#fffaf1);color:var(--ink,#493366);border:0;border-radius:50%;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ds-pause svg{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-pause:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Photo token",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "photo-token",
      "description": "Decorative cream object above upload.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-photo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"m3 17 5-5 4 4 4-6 5 7\"/></svg></div>",
      "css": ".ds-photo{display:grid;place-items:center;width:148px;height:170px;background:var(--cream,#fffaf1);border-radius:24px;transform:rotate(-8deg);box-shadow:0 12px 30px #63458113}.ds-photo svg{width:78px;height:78px;color:#ad89cd;stroke-width:1.2}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Processing orbit",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "creating-orbit",
      "description": "Soft animated object with actual pipeline status.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-creating\" role=\"status\"><div class=\"ds-orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 5c-3-3-6-1-8 1-2-2-5-4-8-1-4 4 1 9 8 15 7-6 12-11 8-15Z\"/></svg></div><p>Mirando tu dibujo…</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-creating{text-align:center;color:var(--ink,#493366)}.ds-creating p{margin:26px 0 0;font:700 20px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif}.ds-orbit{width:112px;height:112px;margin:auto;border-radius:40% 60% 55% 45%;background:#ccb1ec;display:grid;place-items:center;animation:ds-imagining 3s ease-in-out infinite}.ds-orbit svg{width:54px;height:54px;color:#fffaf1}@keyframes ds-imagining{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-10deg) scale(.94);border-radius:40% 60% 55% 45%}50%{transform:rotate(12deg) scale(1.04);border-radius:60% 40% 45% 55%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-orbit{animation:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Burbujas",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "toy-bubbles",
      "description": "Third physical toy starts a five-pop round, stores the ball and preserves an existing food sequence. All three toys hide until exit.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-toy-bubbles\" aria-label=\"Jugar a las burbujas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"68\" rx=\"27\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#63419b15\"/>\n<path d=\"m24 60 14-23\" stroke=\"#6c4699\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"29\" r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6c4699\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"63\" cy=\"13\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#C7B3EB33\" stroke=\"#6c4699\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"23\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#F1ADC833\" stroke=\"#BC5676\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M59 8c1-1 3-2 5-2M38 19c3-2 6-2 8-1\" stroke=\"#fffaf1\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n</svg><span>Burbujas</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-toy-bubbles{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;border:0;padding:0;width:86px;color:var(--ink,#493366);background:transparent;font:700 13px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;user-select:none}.ds-toy-bubbles svg{width:80px;height:80px;pointer-events:none}.ds-toy-bubbles:hover:not(:disabled) svg{filter:brightness(1.04)}.ds-toy-bubbles:active{cursor:grabbing}.ds-toy-bubbles:disabled{cursor:default}.ds-toy-bubbles:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bubble targets",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "bubble-target",
      "description": "Illustrated specimen of the canvas bubbles and transparent native targets. At most three targets exist; each is at least 44px in both dimensions. Tab/Enter and canvas Enter/Space pop bubbles; pause disables them. The golden fifth bubble has a star.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-bubble-pair\"><button class=\"ds-bubble-target\" aria-label=\"Reventar burbuja\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"32\" fill=\"#C7B3EB33\" stroke=\"#6c4699\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M18 31a24 24 0 0 1 18-14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffaf1\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"54\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#fffaf1\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-bubble-target\" aria-label=\"Reventar la burbuja dorada\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#F7D88D66\" stroke=\"#6c4699\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M40 22 45 34 58 35 48 44 51 57 40 50 29 57 32 44 22 35 35 34Z\" fill=\"#F7D88D\" stroke=\"#6c4699\"/><path d=\"M15 31a27 27 0 0 1 21-17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffaf1\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-bubble-pair{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center}.ds-bubble-target{background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:50%;padding:0;width:80px;height:80px;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;touch-action:none}.ds-bubble-target svg{width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}.ds-bubble-target:disabled{cursor:default}.ds-bubble-target:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bubble progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "bubble-progress",
      "description": "Five dots fill from zero through five with each pop; accessible progressbar and live announcements communicate round progress. No countdown, loss state or persistent score.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-bubble-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Burbujas reventadas\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"5\" aria-valuenow=\"3\"><i data-filled=\"true\"></i><i data-filled=\"true\"></i><i data-filled=\"true\"></i><i></i><i></i></div>",
      "css": ".ds-bubble-progress{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:44px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:22px;background:var(--cream,#fffaf1)}.ds-bubble-progress i{width:9px;height:9px;border:1.5px solid var(--violet,#6c4699);border-radius:50%}.ds-bubble-progress i[data-filled=\"true\"]{background:var(--violet,#6c4699)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bubble exit",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-bubble-exit",
      "description": "44px cream close control beside upper-left progress. Exit, Volver or Escape clears the round and returns focus to Burbujas; exit remains available while paused.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-bubble-exit\" aria-label=\"Salir de burbujas\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-bubble-exit{background:var(--cream,#fffaf1);color:var(--ink,#493366);border:0;border-radius:50%;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ds-bubble-exit svg{width:20px;height:20px}.ds-bubble-exit:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bubble success",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "bubble-success",
      "description": "Victory label appears on the fifth pop and remains with replay/back after the 2.4s celebration. Uses the existing 20px action hierarchy.",
      "html": "<p class=\"ds-bubble-success\">¡Lo hiciste!</p>",
      "css": ".ds-bubble-success{margin:0 0 10px;text-align:center;color:var(--ink,#493366);font:700 20px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Otra vez",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-bubble-replay",
      "description": "Bold 14px completion action resets bubbles, progress and particles for a new round. Disabled while paused.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-bubble-replay\">Otra vez</button>",
      "css": ".ds-bubble-replay{border:0;border-radius:22px;padding:12px 18px;min-height:44px;background:var(--violet,#6c4699);color:var(--cream,#fffaf1);font:700 14px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-bubble-replay:hover:not(:disabled){background:#5d3688}.ds-bubble-replay:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.ds-bubble-replay:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Volver",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-bubble-back",
      "description": "Transparent bold completion action exits to the three-toy playroom; paired with Otra vez at an 8px gap.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-bubble-back\">Volver</button>",
      "css": ".ds-bubble-back{border:0;border-radius:22px;padding:12px 18px;min-height:44px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#493366);font:700 14px \"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-bubble-back:hover{background:#dbcbed}.ds-bubble-back:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #724796;outline-offset:5px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Lilac Playroom",
    "overview": "A spacious, playful world where the drawing is the main event. Pale lilac fills the viewport; soft lavender shapes, pink circles and butter stars gather at its edges. Cream objects and rounded controls feel approachable without competing with the character.\n\nThe interface uses local Trebuchet typography, minimal Rioplatense Spanish and recognizable outline drawings. Colored fruit, a ball and a bubble wand sit directly in the character's world. Movement gives the existing character affection and personality while preserving its anatomy; touch receives immediate feedback rather than waiting for a prior reaction to finish.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Open lilac space with peripheral geometric decoration.",
      "Soft cream objects and violet primary actions.",
      "Large character imagery, three physical toys and direct touch reactions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Center Rule",
        "body": "Decorative geometry frames the edges and leaves the central subject legible.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep pastel edge decoration behind the central drawing and controls.",
      "Do pair the three physical toys with short visible labels and preserve clear keyboard focus.",
      "Do keep affection on the character and let new gestures blend or interrupt existing reactions.",
      "Do honor reduced motion and animate only the character anatomy already present."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace the playful lilac world with a dashboard or technical workbench.",
      "Don't add hard offset shadows or substitute text glyphs for the outline icons.",
      "Don't introduce display typography absent from the current action-led hierarchy."
    ]
  }
}
